yleLayer\/circleRadius"},{"type":"text","text":" to an expression for the key path "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"halfway"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer\/text"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer\/iconImageName"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"properties allow you to use attributes yet another way. For example, to label"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"features in an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":" object by their names, you can assign a "},{"code":"name","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attribute to each of the source’s features, then set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer\/text"},{"text":" to an expression for the constant string value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"{name}","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". See the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Predicates and Expressions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"guide for more information about expressions."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In vector tiles loaded by ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource"},{"text":" objects, the keys and values of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each feature’s attribute dictionary are determined by the source. Each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attribut